# Google Sheets API for community levels (GitHub Pages deployment)
#
# OPTION 1: SheetDB (easiest)
# 1. Create a Google Sheet with columns:
#    id, name, description, rows, cols, grid, availableGems, objectives, maxMoves, starThresholds, submittedAt
# 2. Go to https://sheetdb.io and create a free account
# 3. Connect your Google Sheet
# 4. Copy the API URL here
#
# VITE_SHEETS_API=https://sheetdb.io/api/v1/YOUR_API_ID
#
# OPTION 2: Google Apps Script (more control)
# See docs/google-apps-script.js for setup instructions
#
# VITE_SHEETS_API=https://script.google.com/macros/s/YOUR_SCRIPT_ID/exec

